              <p>Only send this if it's true, and only after they've seen the work. Not as a bait-and-switch in the first proposal.</p>
            </aside>
            <div class="copy-block">
              <div class="ap-head">
                <p class="prompt-label">After they have seen the work</p>
                <button type="button" class="copy-btn" data-copy>Copy</button>
              </div>
